OL,3,GNEWSADemolition work under way at      
OL,4,Atown's shopping centre                 
OL,6,FDemolition work at a former shopping   
OL,7,Fcentre is under way, ahead of the site 
OL,8,Fbeing used for hundreds of homes and   
OL,9,Fnew shops.                             
OL,11,FThe Nicholsons Centre in Maidenhead was
OL,12,Fconstructed in the early 1960s with a  
OL,13,Froof being built on the open-air       
OL,14,Fcomplex in the early 1970s.            
OL,16,FThe centre was closed in June ahead of 
OL,17,Fthe revamp, with 850 flats and more    
OL,18,Fthan 50 shops approved to take its     
OL,19,Fplace in the renamed Nicholson Quarter.
